<title>USA: Sage fund 'area' launched on America Online.</title>
<headline>Sage fund 'area' launched on America Online.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sage Financial Group Inc said it launched a new mutual fund area, &quot;Making Sense of Mutual Funds,&quot; with the Mutual Fund Center on America Online Inc.</p>
<p>Sage said the site is intended as an educational forum and a clearinghouse for investors interested in &quot;learning (about), educating (others), and discussing mutual funds.&quot;</p>
<p>The AOL site, called &quot;Sage: Making Sense of Mutual Funds,&quot; includes message boards and chat rooms.</p>
